{
    "title": "ACS CARES",
    "description": "ACS CARES give patients and caregivers the power to navigate their cancer journey with confidence through quality curated information and one-on-one support.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*Access personalized, accurate cancer-related information like screening guidelines and other resources that update as you age, your situation changes, or new information becomes available.\r\n\r\n*Connect one-on-one with trained ACS volunteers who match your shared cancer lived experiences including diagnosis, location, military status, race, ethnicity, and others.\r\n\r\n*Get reliable information on how to address important non-clinical topics such as emotional health, finances, transportation, dependent support and more.\r\n\r\n*Speak to an American Cancer Society information specialist when you have questions day or night, 365 days a year.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDownload the ACS CARES app today and gain the trusted support you need!",
    "descriptionHTML": "ACS CARES give patients and caregivers the power to navigate their cancer journey with confidence through quality curated information and one-on-one support.<br><br> <br><br>*Access personalized, accurate cancer-related information like screening guidelines and other resources that update as you age, your situation changes, or new information becomes available.<br><br>*Connect one-on-one with trained ACS volunteers who match your shared cancer lived experiences including diagnosis, location, military status, race, ethnicity, and others.<br><br>*Get reliable information on how to address important non-clinical topics such as emotional health, finances, transportation, dependent support and more.<br><br>*Speak to an American Cancer Society information specialist when you have questions day or night, 365 days a year.<br><br> <br><br>Download the ACS CARES app today and gain the trusted support you need!",
